-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div><span class="mt-[2px] text-[13px] font-medium text-gray-500">Verified</span></div></div><div class="items-cent flex flex-col gap-2"><span class="line-clamp-2 text-[18px] font-extrabold">Easy to use</span><span class="line-clamp-2 text-[16px]">Easy to use, good service</span><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="max-w-[80px] truncate text-[16px] font-extrabold">Rebecca O&#x27;Leary</span></div></div></div><div class="flex w-[240px] flex-col gap-2 px-4" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><div class="flex gap-2"><img src="//images-static.trustpilot.com/api/stars/5/star.svg" width="110" alt="stars"/><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1"><div class="rounded-full bg-gray-400 p-1 "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-[10px] w-[10px] text-white " fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div><span class="mt-[2px] text-[13px] font-medium text-gray-500">Verified</span></div></div><div class="items-cent flex flex-col gap-2"><span class="line-clamp-2 text-[18px] font-extrabold">Good Service, Very good customer service!</span><span class="line-clamp-2 text-[16px]">I tried their service and was very happy with it, convenient, fast and effective with all types of pdf. I also dealt with customer service and they solved my problem with speed and kindness. Highly recommended!</span><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="max-w-[80px] truncate text-[16px] font-extrabold">mnb</span></div></div></div><div class="flex w-[240px] flex-col gap-2 px-4" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><div class="flex gap-2"><img src="//images-static.trustpilot.com/api/stars/5/star.svg" width="110" alt="stars"/><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1"><div class="rounded-full bg-gray-400 p-1 "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-[10px] w-[10px] text-white " fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div><span class="mt-[2px] text-[13px] font-medium text-gray-500">Verified</span></div></div><div class="items-cent flex flex-col gap-2"><span class="line-clamp-2 text-[18px] font-extrabold">Great experience, high quality service!</span><span class="line-clamp-2 text-[16px]">Thank you for the job done and for your amazing customer service!</span><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="max-w-[80px] truncate text-[16px] font-extrabold">Edit B.Kiss</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> </div>   <astro-island uid="DOxmG" prefix="r7" component-url="/_astro/sections.d7168961.js" component-export="Section" renderer-url="/_astro/client.af180e1a.js" props="{&quot;id&quot;:[0,71],&quot;__component&quot;:[0,&quot;sections.banner&quot;],&quot;cta_title&quot;:[0,&quot;Upload file&quot;],&quot;title&quot;:[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,375],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;H2&quot;],&quot;title&quot;:[0,&quot;Edit PDF Documents Like a Pro &quot;]}],&quot;lang&quot;:[0,&quot;en&quot;],&quot;context&quot;:[0,&quot;home&quot;]}" ssr="" client="idle" opts="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Section&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}" await-children=""><section class="w-full text-[#1D1D1D] pb-12 md:pb-0 pb-0 pt-12 md:pt-28"><div class="bg-upload-pdf-banner bg-cover bg-no-repeat"><div class="items-center gap-6 flex max-w-[1256px] mx-auto flex-col items-center justify-center md:justify-between text-xl font-bold text-white md:gap-12 md:px-16 md:text-4xl md:h-[200px] lg:h-[211px] h-[180px] md:flex-row"><h2 class="text-xl md:text-4xl+">Edit PDF Documents Like a Pro </h2><button class="w-[240px] flex-shrink-0 cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap rounded-3xl bg-[#fff] p-4 md:p-6 text-center text-sm+ font-bold text-[#000] shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_#fff] transition-all duration-300 ease-standard hover:-translate-y-1 md:w-min md:px-[64px] md:py-6 md:text-[20px]" aria-label="Upload file">Upload file</button></div></div></section><!--astro:end--></astro-island>    <astro-island uid="JdzD7" prefix="r8" component-url="/_astro/sections.d7168961.js" component-export="Section" renderer-url="/_astro/client.af180e1a.js" props="{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2],&quot;__component&quot;:[0,&quot;sections.faq&quot;],&quot;title&quot;:[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,19],&quot;type&quot;:[0,&quot;H2&quot;],&quot;title&quot;:[0,&quot;Frequently asked questions&quot;]}],&quot;questions&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,13],&quot;question&quot;:[0,&quot;What is PDF Guru?&quot;],&quot;answer&quot;:[0,&quot;PDF Guru is an online platform that helps users work with PDF files — edit, convert, split, compress, merge them, and so much more. We also support a wide range of formats, allowing users to convert to PDF and from PDF. These include popular ones like Word, Excel, JPG, and PNG, as well as legacy formats like DjVu and specialized formats like DWG. We&#39;re constantly expanding our tool set and improving our current features to meet the needs of our users, making sure to consider their feedback.&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,4191],&quot;question&quot;:[0,&quot;Is PDF Guru safe to use?&quot;],&quot;answer&quot;:[0,&quot;PDF Guru implements several security measures to ensure user safety when handling documents. \n\n1.**Data Protection Compliance:** PDF Guru adheres to GDPR, ensuring that user data is handled with care and only used with permission.\n\n2.** Encryption**: The platform uses SSL (Secure Sockets Layer) encryption to protect files during upload and processing. This ensures that data remains secure from potential interceptors.\n\n3.** Server-Side Encryption:** Even if unauthorized access occurs, the data is protected by a secret code, making it unreadable.\n\n4.**Advanced Encryption Standard (AES):** This encryption method converts data into a format that only authorized parties can decrypt.\n\n5.**Google Safe Browsing Verification:** PDF Guru is confirmed as safe by Google’s service, which monitors for dangerous websites and downloads.\n\nTo learn more about how we keep your files safe, please read our blog article on [PDF Guru&#39;s security measures](https://pdfguru.com/blog/is-pdf-guru-safe).&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,4192],&quot;question&quot;:[0,&quot;Is PDF Guru available as a subscription or a one-time purchase?&quot;],&quot;answer&quot;:[0,&quot;PDF Guru is available as a subscription service, where you can choose between a monthly or yearly plan to suit your needs. Although the monthly plan may seem more affordable at first glance, the yearly subscription, when adjusted per month, offers better value and significant savings over time.&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,4193],&quot;question&quot;:[0,&quot;Which operating systems is PDF Guru available on?&quot;],&quot;answer&quot;:[0,&quot;PDF Guru is a web application that can be accessed via any browser on any device with an internet connection.\n\nUnlike installed software, online applications are compatible with many different operating systems. You can use PDF Guru to manage PDF files and modify them on Mac OS, Windows, Linux, iOS devices, or Android as long as you’re connected to the Internet.&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,4194],&quot;question&quot;:[0,&quot;What features does PDF Guru offer?&quot;],&quot;answer&quot;:[0,&quot;PDF Guru offers many editing tools, but it is especially popular for its editing and converting capabilities. With our PDF editor, you can:\n\n- Annotate PDF files;\n- Fill out PDF forms;\n- Rotate PDF pages;\n- Organize PDF pages in order;\n- Delete PDF pages or add new ones;\n- Create PDF files from scratch;\n- Sign PDFs;\n- Password-protect PDF documents.\n\nApart from this, you can also use our platform to:\n\n- Compress the size of your PDF files;\n- Split PDFs into individual pages;\n- Merge PDF files into one.\n\nAnd of course, you can convert files to the PDF format and vice versa. &quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,4195],&quot;question&quot;:[0,&quot;What types of files does PDF Guru support?&quot;],&quot;answer&quot;:[0,&quot;To date, our online to PDF converter supports the following formats: Word, JPG, PNG, Excel, EPUB, DOC, DOCX, HTML, TXT, PPTX, MOBI, SVG, CSV, AZW3, PPT, etc. However, we&#39;re always expanding our list of available file extensions to make PDF management more convenient for our users. Therefore, if you want to request a specific format, feel free to share your proposal with our support team.&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,4196],&quot;question&quot;:[0,&quot;What should I do if I encounter issues or errors while using PDF Guru?&quot;],&quot;answer&quot;:[0,&quot;If you have any doubts or difficulties using our PDF tool, please contact us via any of these channels:\n\n- E-mail: support@pdfguru.com\n- Phone: +1 (866) 716-6045\n\nWe provide human customer support 24/7, even on holidays and weekends, which sets us apart from companies that rely solely on chatbots. Our experienced consultants are always available to guide you through any problem.&quot;]}]]],&quot;lang&quot;:[0,&quot;en&quot;],&quot;context&quot;:[0,&quot;home&quot;]}" ssr="" client="idle" opts="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Section&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}" await-children=""><section class="mx-auto max-w-[1256px] box-content px-4 pb-12 text-[#1D1D1D] md:px-20 md:py-28"><h2 id="faq" class="text-center text-2xl font-black md:text-4xl-max">Frequently asked questions</h2><ul class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-6 md:mt-[64px]"><li><div class="duraion-300 w-full cursor-pointer rounded-3xl border-[1px] border-dashed border-[#575757] bg-[#F6F6F6] p-8 pb-4 text-left outline-none transition-all ease-standard"><div class="flex w-full flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-4"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl">What is PDF Guru?</h3><img src="/arrow-down.svg" alt="" class="h-8 w-8" style="transform:none"/></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:auto"><div class="text-base md:text-xl"><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">PDF Guru is an online platform that helps users work with PDF files — edit, convert, split, compress, merge them, and so much more. We also support a wide range of formats, allowing users to convert to PDF and from PDF. These include popular ones like Word, Excel, JPG, and PNG, as well as legacy formats like DjVu and specialized formats like DWG. We&#x27;re constantly expanding our tool set and improving our current features to meet the needs of our users, making sure to consider their feedback.</p></div></div></div></li><li><div class="duraion-300 w-full cursor-pointer rounded-3xl border-[1px] border-dashed border-[#575757] bg-[#F6F6F6] p-8 pb-4 text-left outline-none transition-all ease-standard"><div class="flex w-full flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-4"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl">Is PDF Guru safe to use?</h3><img src="/arrow-down.svg" alt="" class="h-8 w-8" style="transform:none"/></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:auto"><div class="text-base md:text-xl"><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">PDF Guru implements several security measures to ensure user safety when handling documents. </p><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">1.<strong>Data Protection Compliance:</strong> PDF Guru adheres to GDPR, ensuring that user data is handled with care and only used with permission.</p><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">2.<strong> Encryption</strong>: The platform uses SSL (Secure Sockets Layer) encryption to protect files during upload and processing. This ensures that data remains secure from potential interceptors.</p><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">3.<strong> Server-Side Encryption:</strong> Even if unauthorized access occurs, the data is protected by a secret code, making it unreadable.</p><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">4.<strong>Advanced Encryption Standard (AES):</strong> This encryption method converts data into a format that only authorized parties can decrypt.</p><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">5.<strong>Google Safe Browsing Verification:</strong> PDF Guru is confirmed as safe by Google’s service, which monitors for dangerous websites and downloads.</p><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">To learn more about how we keep your files safe, please read our blog article on <a href="https://pdfguru.com/blog/is-pdf-guru-safe">PDF Guru&#x27;s security measures</a>.</p></div></div></div></li><li><div class="duraion-300 w-full cursor-pointer rounded-3xl border-[1px] border-dashed border-[#575757] bg-[#F6F6F6] p-8 pb-4 text-left outline-none transition-all ease-standard"><div class="flex w-full flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-4"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl">Is PDF Guru available as a subscription or a one-time purchase?</h3><img src="/arrow-down.svg" alt="" class="h-8 w-8" style="transform:none"/></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:auto"><div class="text-base md:text-xl"><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">PDF Guru is available as a subscription service, where you can choose between a monthly or yearly plan to suit your needs. Although the monthly plan may seem more affordable at first glance, the yearly subscription, when adjusted per month, offers better value and significant savings over time.</p></div></div></div></li><li><div class="duraion-300 w-full cursor-pointer rounded-3xl border-[1px] border-dashed border-[#575757] bg-[#F6F6F6] p-8 pb-4 text-left outline-none transition-all ease-standard"><div class="flex w-full flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-4"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl">Which operating systems is PDF Guru available on?</h3><img src="/arrow-down.svg" alt="" class="h-8 w-8" style="transform:none"/></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:auto"><div class="text-base md:text-xl"><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">PDF Guru is a web application that can be accessed via any browser on any device with an internet connection.</p><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">Unlike installed software, online applications are compatible with many different operating systems. You can use PDF Guru to manage PDF files and modify them on Mac OS, Windows, Linux, iOS devices, or Android as long as you’re connected to the Internet.</p></div></div></div></li><li><div class="duraion-300 w-full cursor-pointer rounded-3xl border-[1px] border-dashed border-[#575757] bg-[#F6F6F6] p-8 pb-4 text-left outline-none transition-all ease-standard"><div class="flex w-full flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-4"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl">What features does PDF Guru offer?</h3><img src="/arrow-down.svg" alt="" class="h-8 w-8" style="transform:none"/></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:auto"><div class="text-base md:text-xl"><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">PDF Guru offers many editing tools, but it is especially popular for its editing and converting capabilities. With our PDF editor, you can:</p><ul class="ml-1 list-outside list-disc pb-2 pl-8 pt-2"><li>Annotate PDF files;</li><li>Fill out PDF forms;</li><li>Rotate PDF pages;</li><li>Organize PDF pages in order;</li><li>Delete PDF pages or add new ones;</li><li>Create PDF files from scratch;</li><li>Sign PDFs;</li><li>Password-protect PDF documents.</li></ul><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">Apart from this, you can also use our platform to:</p><ul class="ml-1 list-outside list-disc pb-2 pl-8 pt-2"><li>Compress the size of your PDF files;</li><li>Split PDFs into individual pages;</li><li>Merge PDF files into one.</li></ul><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">And of course, you can convert files to the PDF format and vice versa. </p></div></div></div></li><li><div class="duraion-300 w-full cursor-pointer rounded-3xl border-[1px] border-dashed border-[#575757] bg-[#F6F6F6] p-8 pb-4 text-left outline-none transition-all ease-standard"><div class="flex w-full flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-4"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl">What types of files does PDF Guru support?</h3><img src="/arrow-down.svg" alt="" class="h-8 w-8" style="transform:none"/></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:auto"><div class="text-base md:text-xl"><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">To date, our online to PDF converter supports the following formats: Word, JPG, PNG, Excel, EPUB, DOC, DOCX, HTML, TXT, PPTX, MOBI, SVG, CSV, AZW3, PPT, etc. However, we&#x27;re always expanding our list of available file extensions to make PDF management more convenient for our users. Therefore, if you want to request a specific format, feel free to share your proposal with our support team.</p></div></div></div></li><li><div class="duraion-300 w-full cursor-pointer rounded-3xl border-[1px] border-dashed border-[#575757] bg-[#F6F6F6] p-8 pb-4 text-left outline-none transition-all ease-standard"><div class="flex w-full flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-4"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl">What should I do if I encounter issues or errors while using PDF Guru?</h3><img src="/arrow-down.svg" alt="" class="h-8 w-8" style="transform:none"/></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:auto"><div class="text-base md:text-xl"><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">If you have any doubts or difficulties using our PDF tool, please contact us via any of these channels:</p><ul class="ml-1 list-outside list-disc pb-2 pl-8 pt-2"><li>E-mail: support@pdfguru.com</li><li>Phone: +1 (866) 716-6045</li></ul><p class="pb-1 pt-1 first-of-type:pt-0 last-of-type:pb-0 md:pr-16">We provide human customer support 24/7, even on holidays and weekends, which sets us apart from companies that rely solely on chatbots. Our experienced consultants are always available to guide you through any problem.</p></div></div></div></li></ul></section><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is PDF Guru?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PDF Guru is an online platform that helps users work with PDF files — edit, convert, split, compress, merge them, and so much more. We also support a wide range of formats, allowing users to convert to PDF and from PDF. These include popular ones like Word, Excel, JPG, and PNG, as well as legacy formats like DjVu and specialized formats like DWG. We're constantly expanding our tool set and improving our current features to meet the needs of our users, making sure to consider their feedback."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is PDF Guru safe to use?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PDF Guru implements several security measures to ensure user safety when handling documents. \n\n1.**Data Protection Compliance:** PDF Guru adheres to GDPR, ensuring that user data is handled with care and only used with permission.\n\n2.** Encryption**: The platform uses SSL (Secure Sockets Layer) encryption to protect files during upload and processing. This ensures that data remains secure from potential interceptors.\n\n3.** Server-Side Encryption:** Even if unauthorized access occurs, the data is protected by a secret code, making it unreadable.\n\n4.**Advanced Encryption Standard (AES):** This encryption method converts data into a format that only authorized parties can decrypt.\n\n5.**Google Safe Browsing Verification:** PDF Guru is confirmed as safe by Google’s service, which monitors for dangerous websites and downloads.\n\nTo learn more about how we keep your files safe, please read our blog article on [PDF Guru's security measures](https://pdfguru.com/blog/is-pdf-guru-safe)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is PDF Guru available as a subscription or a one-time purchase?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PDF Guru is available as a subscription service, where you can choose between a monthly or yearly plan to suit your needs. Although the monthly plan may seem more affordable at first glance, the yearly subscription, when adjusted per month, offers better value and significant savings over time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which operating systems is PDF Guru available on?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PDF Guru is a web application that can be accessed via any browser on any device with an internet connection.\n\nUnlike installed software, online applications are compatible with many different operating systems. You can use PDF Guru to manage PDF files and modify them on Mac OS, Windows, Linux, iOS devices, or Android as long as you’re connected to the Internet."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What features does PDF Guru offer?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PDF Guru offers many editing tools, but it is especially popular for its editing and converting capabilities. With our PDF editor, you can:\n\n- Annotate PDF files;\n- Fill out PDF forms;\n- Rotate PDF pages;\n- Organize PDF pages in order;\n- Delete PDF pages or add new ones;\n- Create PDF files from scratch;\n- Sign PDFs;\n- Password-protect PDF documents.\n\nApart from this, you can also use our platform to:\n\n- Compress the size of your PDF files;\n- Split PDFs into individual pages;\n- Merge PDF files into one.\n\nAnd of course, you can convert files to the PDF format and vice versa. "}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of files does PDF Guru support?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"To date, our online to PDF converter supports the following formats: Word, JPG, PNG, Excel, EPUB, DOC, DOCX, HTML, TXT, PPTX, MOBI, SVG, CSV, AZW3, PPT, etc. However, we're always expanding our list of available file extensions to make PDF management more convenient for our users. Therefore, if you want to request a specific format, feel free to share your proposal with our support team."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What should I do if I encounter issues or errors while using PDF Guru?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"If you have any doubts or difficulties using our PDF tool, please contact us via any of these channels:\n\n- E-mail: support@pdfguru.com\n- Phone: +1 (866) 716-6045\n\nWe provide human customer support 24/7, even on holidays and weekends, which sets us apart from companies that rely solely on chatbots. Our experienced consultants are always available to guide you through any problem."}}]}</script><!--astro:end--></astro-island>    <astro-island uid="1xBCY" prefix="r9" component-url="/_astro/sections.d7168961.js" component-export="Section" renderer-url="/_astro/client.af180e1a.js" props="{&quot;id&quot;:[0,8],&quot;__component&quot;:[0,&quot;blog.related-articles&quot;],&quot;title&quot;:[0,&quot;Related articles&quot;],&quot;related_articles&quot;:[0,{&quot;data&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,31],&quot;attributes&quot;:[0,{&quot;title&quot;:[0,&quot;Are Your Files Safe with PDF Guru?&quot;],&quot;reading_time&quot;:[0,10],&quot;views_number&quot;:[0,5391],&quot;publication_date&quot;:[0,&quot;2024-08-15&quot;],&quot;slug&quot;:[0,&quot;/is-pdf-guru-safe&quot;],&quot;createdAt&quot;:[0,&quot;2024-08-15T11:30:24.501Z&quot;],&quot;updatedAt&quot;:[0,&quot;2024-11-29T13:29:17.697Z&quot;],&quot;publishedAt&quot;:[0,&quot;2024-08-15T11:30:25.882Z&quot;],&quot;locale&quot;:[0,&quot;en&quot;],&quot;tag&quot;:[0,&quot;lifestyle&quot;],&quot;bg_image&quot;:[0,{&quot;data&quot;:[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2119],&quot;attributes&quot;:[0,{&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;pdf-guru-safe-cover.svg&quot;],&quot;alternativeText&quot;:[0,&quot;is pdf guru safe &quot;],&quot;caption&quot;:[0,null],&quot;width&quot;